body:
The following compiles on the current nightly (1.67.0-nightly (2022-12-03 23415176968e81e0aac9)) although it shouldn't:
```rust
fn test<'s: 's>(s: &'s str) -> impl std::future::Future<Output = impl Sized> {
    async move { let _s = s; }
}
```
It is correctly rejected by the current beta: 1.66.0-beta.2 (2022-11-20 0040709e39bfa159d099).

This is most likely #103491 (I haven't bisected though!). Cc @cjgillot.

@rustbot label C-bug T-compiler I-unsound regression-from-stable-to-nightly A-impl-trait
